{"id":"vod_sn_36516","vodId":"36516","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"新罗马浴场","name_cn":"新罗马浴场","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5d81508b47493a12e083d45cda8b9e57.jpg"},"summary":"时间回到称霸古代的罗马帝国。对于荣耀的罗马人来说，洗温泉（浴）是其生活中必不可少的一部分。卢修斯追随父亲和祖父的脚步，成为了一名澡堂设计师。然而，当他因设计理念过于陈旧而被解雇时，卢修斯作为澡堂设计师的未来也蒙上阴影。有一天，他被吸入了公共浴池的大排水管，最后顺着急流流向…日本澡堂！卢修斯不知道自己穿越了时空，他被日本浴室文化所感动，包括墙上的壁画和水果牛奶饮料。他把能提升泡澡体验的物品带回古罗马，成为了受欢迎的澡堂设计师。　　Netflix 剧集《新罗马浴场》于 3 月 28 日全球上线，Netflix 独家。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SPPePDXyjG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0dwPqLH6Fm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rX1jTNtfVP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L9VJWJPNa01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mBsTxqzN6r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NEa5Z3YxDX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9e8uQY1RLT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BmadKfFfgK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/brhxEPMCNe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nYLgdwPhGm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F7YKgCHbDH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.981Z"}